  "record_union": {
    "model": "Released LuPastry+, counted routing function, NextMC, TypeInvariant and CorrectDelivery, B=L=1. Shape IDs give ring size and number of IDs initially eligible to join. Other IDs start ready (0 through ring_size - joining - 1).",
    "cause": "Closed Message is a record whose content is a binary union of eight tagged record types; members include routing functions and filtered leaf records. Startup tried to materialize whole products even when checking an empty MessagePool. A one-state stutter with just pool membership reproduced the failure. Routing, LeafSets, CorrectDelivery and a no-invariant control passed separately.",
    "baseline": "On the earlier ordinary Core eight IDs with one or two joiners exhausted a 15 GiB cgroup. OOM affected the checker before a successful result. The outer systemd-client RSS for those runs is excluded.",
    "comparison": "EC2 c7i.4xlarge in us-east-2, Linux x86_64. Matrix used four separate physical cores (IDs 0-3), sequential engines, MemoryMax=12G. The unchanged 16-ID leaf declaration was bounded to 3 GiB/77 s for Core and TLC. Qualified candidate used CPU 4-7, checker --max-memory 700m, cgroup 800M. Parts of the panels overlapped on these separate cores. GNU time inside the cgroup measures process wall seconds and peak RSS KiB including process startup; distinct CPU placement and binary hashes identify each series.",
    "command_core": "dive check Pastry.tla --config Model.cfg --library-path LIB --workers 4 --store exact --fp 0 --seed 0 --output json (compat also passes --compat=tlc).",
    "command_tlc": "java -Xmx8g -XX:ActiveProcessorCount=4 -XX:+UseParallelGC -DTLA-Library=LIB -cp tla2tools.jar tlc2.TLC -workers 4 -fp 0 -seed 0 -metadir SCRATCH -config Model.cfg Pastry.tla",
    "leaf_bound": "--singleton-leaves changes just the candidate domain of LeafSet. With L=1, each side must be empty or a singleton. The original self-exclusion and cardinality tests remain. Other L use the original SUBSET bound. Eight IDs reduce the candidate count from 524288 to 648; sixteen from 68719476736 to 4624 (4096 pass the filter).",
